<h2>Asobi Review 0.8 (build 632)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Past Reviews scrolls in place.</b> Once the list passes six reviews it scrolls within its own area instead of stretching the panel, and a share that was never ended reads <b>expired</b> once its link has lapsed.</li>
</ul>
